      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7307307",
      "subQuestName": "Dig for the Amiti Device",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730730701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730730701": {
            "id": "730730701",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Jazari",
            "text": "Yes, this is indeed the Amiti Device.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730702"
            ]
          },
          "730730702": {
            "id": "730730702",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "See? I didn't lie to you guys!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730703"
            ]
          },
          "730730703": {
            "id": "730730703",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yay! Now we can scuttle right back and open that giant robot up, right? Hehe, Paimon's getting excited already!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730704"
            ]
          },
          "730730704": {
            "id": "730730704",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Jazari",
            "text": "Hmm. Alas, this is just a fragment. There's no way we will open the Ruin Golem without a complete device.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730705"
            ]
          },
          "730730705": {
            "id": "730730705",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Jazari",
            "text": "I can fix it if it's not been completely destroyed, but we will have to find some way to recover the remaining pieces.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730706"
            ]
          },
          "730730706": {
            "id": "730730706",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And as for these remaining fragments...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730707"
            ]
          },
          "730730707": {
            "id": "730730707",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "Oh, don't be so anxious. The device was split into three parts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730708"
            ]
          },
          "730730708": {
            "id": "730730708",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "But why would grandpa put them in three different locations...? You know what? This would be a very exciting story, if only I remembered more of it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730709"
            ]
          },
          "730730709": {
            "id": "730730709",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Three different places... So, are the locations of the fragments recorded here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730710"
            ]
          },
          "730730710": {
            "id": "730730710",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "Yes, that's right. The locations of the buried device fragments are all recorded in this handbook. We must have found the fragment buried here back then from... wherever it was at first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730711"
            ]
          },
          "730730711": {
            "id": "730730711",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#In that case, let's go find the remaining two fragments using this. We're the best at finding things, aren't we, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730713"
            ]
          },
          "730730713": {
            "id": "730730713",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#...Mm, yeah, Paimon knows what you mean. It's alright, though! We'll surely find {F#him}{M#her}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730715"
            ]
          },
          "730730715": {
            "id": "730730715",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "Heh. That's what I said, anyway, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730716"
            ]
          },
          "730730716": {
            "id": "730730716",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730717"
            ]
          },
          "730730717": {
            "id": "730730717",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "I can't understand these writings.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730718"
            ]
          },
          "730730718": {
            "id": "730730718",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? How can that be? Didn't you write these notes yourself?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730719"
            ]
          },
          "730730719": {
            "id": "730730719",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "Um... Well, this is actually a record of the adventure that the two... Well, maybe the three of us undertook.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730720"
            ]
          },
          "730730720": {
            "id": "730730720",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "I can't remember who this third person was, but I certainly haven't forgotten that old man. If you want to know the location of the remaining device fragments, you should go look for him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730721"
            ]
          },
          "730730721": {
            "id": "730730721",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "That old man should still be kicking even now, and if he is, he definitely still lives in Vimara Village. He did say he would live out the rest of his days there, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730722"
            ]
          },
          "730730722": {
            "id": "730730722",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The old man you're talking about is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730723"
            ]
          },
          "730730723": {
            "id": "730730723",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Amadhiah, maybe?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730724"
            ]
          },
          "730730724": {
            "id": "730730724",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "Oh? You know that old fellow? Well, that makes things easier! Take this handbook and show it to him. He should understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730725"
            ]
          },
          "730730725": {
            "id": "730730725",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? You aren't gonna come with us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730726"
            ]
          },
          "730730726": {
            "id": "730730726",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "Hmph, I don't want to meet that old fossil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730727"
            ]
          },
          "730730727": {
            "id": "730730727",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "If you've figured out where the fragments are buried, go look for them yourself. I would like to go with you, but my old bones aren't up to the task anymore.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730728"
            ]
          },
          "730730728": {
            "id": "730730728",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "I wanted to be a great adventurer like my grandfather back when I was a young boy. And if it hadn't been for that guy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730729"
            ]
          },
          "730730729": {
            "id": "730730729",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "...Well. Stories are, in the end, more important than the adventure itself. So if you collect any stories, please remember to bring them to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730730730"
            ]
          },
          "730730730": {
            "id": "730730730",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Royinjan",
            "text": "I can give you guys this device fragment as a reward. How about that? It's a good deal, right?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7307308",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Amadhiah",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730731001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730731001": {
            "id": "730731001",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "Ah, we meet again, friends of Rana. Is she not with you? I wonder what's taking her so long to patrol the woods this time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731002"
            ]
          },
          "730731002": {
            "id": "730731002",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "Still, this must be a special occasion, for you to come to see me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731003"
            ]
          },
          "730731003": {
            "id": "730731003",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, yeah. It's for...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731004"
            ]
          },
          "730731004": {
            "id": "730731004",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You tell Amadhiah about Royinjan, the secret base, and the handbook.\\nIt is a story with a lot of twists.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731005"
            ]
          },
          "730731005": {
            "id": "730731005",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "So you went to the secret base. What do you think? Pretty impressive, isn't it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731006"
            ]
          },
          "730731006": {
            "id": "730731006",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "Royinjan is here in Vimara and still doesn't want to see me. That fellow gets more stubborn the older he gets...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731007"
            ]
          },
          "730731007": {
            "id": "730731007",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "That's how he is, though. It's almost been ten years since I last saw him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731008"
            ]
          },
          "730731008": {
            "id": "730731008",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "And that was when I had some business in Port Ormos. I'm relieved to hear he's still himself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731009"
            ]
          },
          "730731009": {
            "id": "730731009",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That's an odd relationship you have between you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731010"
            ]
          },
          "730731010": {
            "id": "730731010",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So why doesn't Royinjan want to see you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731011"
            ]
          },
          "730731011": {
            "id": "730731011",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "It's a long story... You wouldn't mind hearing an old man prattle on, would you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731013",
              "730731015"
            ]
          },
          "730731013": {
            "id": "730731013",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes, Paimon wants to know too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731016"
            ]
          },
          "730731016": {
            "id": "730731016",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "Back when we were kids, Royinjan lived in Vimara for a while because of his grandfather.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731017"
            ]
          },
          "730731017": {
            "id": "730731017",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "As a kid from bustling Port Ormos with a legendary adventurer for his grandfather, Royinjan quickly drew the attention of the other kids.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731018"
            ]
          },
          "730731018": {
            "id": "730731018",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "I was one of those kids who was fascinated by the stories he heard from his grandfather.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731019"
            ]
          },
          "730731019": {
            "id": "730731019",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "Together, we built a \"secret base\" in a cave and dressed ourselves up as warriors and heroes with branches and flowers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731020"
            ]
          },
          "730731020": {
            "id": "730731020",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "To us children, the base was another world, where we went through countless imaginary adventures.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731021"
            ]
          },
          "730731021": {
            "id": "730731021",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "Those old times seem like a dream now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730731022"
            ]
          },
          "730731022": {
            "id": "730731022",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Royinjan also mentioned that the base once played host to loads of kids, so what happened?"
          },
          "730731015": {
            "id": "730731015",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amadhiah",
            "text": "Ha, I'll make it short!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7307310",
      "subQuestName": "Search for the mechanical components",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
